% NPL SOURCE REFERENCE - MON 60B 123B - IMRELSPES release ND-500+memory from test-monitor (verbatim, 5P-P2-MON60.NPL)
IMRELSPES:   % FUNCTION=123: RELEASE ND-500 AND MEMORY FROM THE TEST-MONITOR
       IF CCPUDF.SPREF><RTREF GO FAR 5OKRET       % RESERVED FOR SPECIAL USE BY THE CALLER?
       GO FAR 5NOPAR; *)FILL                      % YES, CONTINUE TO RELEASE MEMORY
